<header class="page-hero">
  <h1>See nearby ADS-B traffic in your navigation app.</h1>
  <p class="page-hero-subtitle">skyBlip Bravo receives the positions of other aircraft fitted with ADS-B that share your altitudes and airspace. Install its firmware on a Seeed SenseCAP MeshTracker X1 to send that traffic over Bluetooth to SDVFR, SkyDemon or another compatible navigation app. Bravo works on its own.</p>

  <figure class="hero-figure hero-figure--wide">
